#. module: sentry_client
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:sentry_client.res_config_settings_view_form
msgid ""
"Browser DSN, environment, and release tags. Leave blank to inherit from the "
"sentry_* options in odoo.conf — useful when the same Sentry project is "
"shared with the server-side OCA `sentry` module. Sentry recommends a "
"separate project per platform; set a dedicated Browser DSN here to split "
"JavaScript events from backend Python events."
msgstr ""

